{"id":"85d79aec1c45c3f2","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/783_Dunn–Belnap_四值逻辑_FDE.md","title":"783 Dunn–Belnap 四值逻辑 FDE","display":"783_Dunn–Belnap_四值逻辑_FDE","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"783-Dunn-Belnap-四值逻辑-FDE\">783 Dunn-Belnap 四值逻辑 FDE</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B\">\\(p,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>自由变元函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(B),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(B),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{FDE}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{FDE}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\}\\)</span>，并定义替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{FDE}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{FDE}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{FDE}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{FDE}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{FDE}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{FDE}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 为唯一满足下列递归子句的映射：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子；相应函数与关系的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{FDE}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,FDE}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{FDE}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,FDE}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{FDE}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,FDE}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{FDE}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,FDE}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-四值真伪证据矩阵\">4. 四值真伪证据矩阵</h1>\n<p>值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{FDE}=\\{0,1\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{FDE}=\\{0,1\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t,f)\">\\((t,f)\\)</span> 的第一坐标表示真证据，第二坐标表示伪证据。指定值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D_{FDE}=\\{(1,0),(1,1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf D_{FDE}=\\{(1,0),(1,1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义运算的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{FDE}:\\mathsf V_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf V_{FDE},\n\\qquad\n\\wedge_{FDE},\\vee_{FDE}:\\mathsf V_{FDE}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{FDE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{FDE}:\\mathsf V_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf V_{FDE},\n\\qquad\n\\wedge_{FDE},\\vee_{FDE}:\\mathsf V_{FDE}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{FDE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐点定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{FDE}(t,f)=(f,t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{FDE}(t,f)=(f,t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(t,f)\\wedge_{FDE}(u,g)=(\\min(t,u),\\max(f,g)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(t,f)\\wedge_{FDE}(u,g)=(\\min(t,u),\\max(f,g)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(t,f)\\vee_{FDE}(u,g)=(\\max(t,u),\\min(f,g)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(t,f)\\vee_{FDE}(u,g)=(\\max(t,u),\\min(f,g)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书\">5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf V_{FDE}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf V_{FDE}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE}\">\\(v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE}\\)</span> 的扩张具有类型</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf V_{FDE},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\to\\mathsf V_{FDE},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{FDE}\\overline v(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{FDE}\\overline v(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{FDE}\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{FDE}\\overline v(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{FDE}\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{FDE}\\overline v(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{FDE})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{FDE}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{FDE})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{FDE}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-语义后承\">6. 语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{FDE}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{FDE}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{FDE}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{FDE}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{FDE}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{FDE}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{FDE}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{FDE}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{FDE}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{FDE}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除\">7. 语义证书与证明对象排除</h1>\n<p>语义证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}\\)</span>，定义可核验证书对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{FDE}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{FDE}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{FDE}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{FDE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{FDE}\">\\(\\Vdash_{FDE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE}\">\\(\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE}\\)</span> 均由本文件的真值集合、指定值集合、赋值扩张和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE}\\)</span> 定义；不引用外部代数类、公式类或命名基逻辑。</p>\n<p>形式证明规则关系的类型及取值声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FDE}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FDE}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FDE}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FDE}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目是四值真伪证据语义后承系统；因此不定义非空 Hilbert 公理集合、证明序列或由规则生成的可证关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个语义形式系统\">8. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{FDE}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE},\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE},\\operatorname{BV}_{FDE},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{FDE},\\operatorname{Ext}_{FDE},\\equiv_{\\alpha,FDE},\n\\mathsf V_{FDE},\\mathsf D_{FDE},\n\\neg_{FDE},\\wedge_{FDE},\\vee_{FDE},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE},\n\\Vdash_{FDE},\\mathsf{Valid}_{FDE},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{FDE},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FDE}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{FDE}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{FDE},\\mathsf{Fm}_{FDE},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FDE},\\operatorname{BV}_{FDE},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{FDE},\\operatorname{Ext}_{FDE},\\equiv_{\\alpha,FDE},\n\\mathsf V_{FDE},\\mathsf D_{FDE},\n\\neg_{FDE},\\wedge_{FDE},\\vee_{FDE},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{FDE},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{FDE},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FDE},\n\\Vdash_{FDE},\\mathsf{Valid}_{FDE},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{FDE},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FDE}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是值为真伪证据对，缺真 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,0)\">\\((0,0)\\)</span> 与冲突 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,1)\">\\((1,1)\\)</span> 均为原始值；该条目只定义语义后承、反例证书和代换保持关系，不含额外证明演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"783-Dunn-Belnap-四值逻辑-FDE","text":"783 Dunn-Belnap 四值逻辑 FDE","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价",